There isn't actually a specific tool exposed by the MCP server for changing the theme,

132
00:13:32,060 --> 00:13:40,300
but the AI is able to figure it out by reading the existing burp config and modifying the JSON in place.

133
00:13:41,120 --> 00:13:44,940
I've also used it in the past to solve a wide variety of Web Academy labs,

134
00:13:45,160 --> 00:13:50,040
and it also has assisted me in learning some web app pen testing concepts in burp.

135
00:13:52,780 --> 00:13:59,820
So, at the moment, here's what I would recommend if you're really keen to start trying out AI-assisted workflows as a burp user.

136
00:13:59,820 --> 00:14:08,140
One, try out the MCP server extension that I just showed you to get access to those burp tools and extend it with some external ones.

137
00:14:08,700 --> 00:14:17,200
You can create your own sort of custom AI pen testing environment to interact with burp and any other tools that you use for your pen tests.

138
00:14:18,380 --> 00:14:24,960
You can experiment with a wide range of contexts and tasks when using agentic systems, such as burp AI and repeater.

139
00:14:24,960 --> 00:14:33,960
You might be surprised by the range of what they can do, so really push the limits and see if something that you don't expect it to be able to do is actually possible.

140
00:14:35,060 --> 00:14:41,860
And if they suit your needs, non-agentic AI tools can also solve some of the more specific problems fairly consistently.

141
00:14:42,300 --> 00:14:45,180
They're really common in people's workflows.

142
00:14:45,180 --> 00:14:59,040
So, in terms of like the future of burp AI, we have a pretty exciting roadmap to announce soon, and we're looking forward to bringing AI into our DAS platform, which is more of like our enterprise offering.

143
00:15:00,320 --> 00:15:06,420
And we also have some really cool capabilities that we're planning to add in the coming months across Burp Suite.

144
00:15:07,100 --> 00:15:09,000
So, yeah, keep an eye out.

145
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:38,980
Thank you.

